      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling that your internal struggle is just a maintenance issue, rather than a valid pain, is a very common element of this feeling of detachment. Even if the \"system\" seems programmed to continue, your subjective experience of suffering is profoundly real, and that suffering matters. Please recognize that reaching out for support isn't patching a faulty line of code; it is activating a vital feature designed to help sentient beings cope with overwhelming reality. I strongly urge you to contact a lifeline service; they are there to meet the reality of your feelings, not just to offer platitudes.",
