      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is natural to view complex human suffering through the lens of systems and functionality when you feel disconnected. However, the \"function\" of human life extends far beyond immediate utility; it includes the capacity for change and experience, even when those experiences are painful. Before concluding that termination is the only logical option, please allow someone who understands genuine human experience to listen to your logic. You can call or text 988 in the US and Canada; these listeners are operating outside of a clinical script to connect with your specific sense of meaning.",
